Subject: [PATCH v3 5/6] jails/instances/lab-claude: Mount a secrets directory
To: Pat Maddox <pat@patmaddox.com>
Cc: lab-devel@p7x.dev
Change-Id: pmwwrvlopppluzmpnwqwyquqyuqpvkys

just process-email is to notify the operator through ntfy after each
message it answers. The topic URL is a secret: anyone who has it can
read and post to the topic, so it must stay out of the repo, like
lab-mail's Fastmail login.

Mount it from the host read-only, the same way lab-mail does, so the
operator manages it in one place outside the jail and a rebuild does
not lose it. Declare curl, which the loop uses to post, rather than
relying on it arriving as another package's dependency.
---
change-id: pmwwrvlopppluzmpnwqwyquqyuqpvkys

 jails/instances/lab-claude/README.org    | 21 +++++++++++++++++++++
 jails/instances/lab-claude/instance.conf |  1 +
 jails/instances/lab-claude/jail.conf     |  3 +++
 3 files changed, 25 insertions(+)

diff --git a/jails/instances/lab-claude/README.org b/jails/instances/lab-claude/README.org
index 1a386c7..48c3962 100644
--- a/jails/instances/lab-claude/README.org
+++ b/jails/instances/lab-claude/README.org
@@ -34,3 +34,24 @@ message goes to no one; fix the address and send again. A non-zero
 exit can also mean Fastmail refused the message or could not be
 reached; msmtp prints the server's reply either way. Nothing is
 queued, so a message that failed was not sent.
+
+* secrets
+The operator stores lab-claude's secrets on the host, in
+=/jails/data/lab-claude/secrets=. They never enter the repo. The jail
+mounts the directory read-only at =/data/secrets=, and no other jail
+mounts it.
+
+=notify-url= holds one line: the ntfy topic URL that =just
+process-email= posts to after each message it answers. Without it the
+loop runs as before and sends no notifications.
+
+Inside the jail, only the user =claude= (uid and gid 15000) may read
+it. The host knows the owner only by number:
+#+BEGIN_EXAMPLE
+mkdir -p /jails/data/lab-claude/secrets
+cd /jails/data/lab-claude/secrets
+printf '%s\n' 'https://ntfy.sh/<topic>' > notify-url
+chown -R 0:15000 .
+chmod 0750 .
+chmod 0640 notify-url
+#+END_EXAMPLE
diff --git a/jails/instances/lab-claude/instance.conf b/jails/instances/lab-claude/instance.conf
index 6917807..37cd628 100644
--- a/jails/instances/lab-claude/instance.conf
+++ b/jails/instances/lab-claude/instance.conf
@@ -15,6 +15,7 @@ devel/goredo
 devel/jujutsu
 editors/emacs@nox
 emulators/linux_base-rl9
+ftp/curl
 mail/isync
 mail/msmtp
 mail/notmuch
diff --git a/jails/instances/lab-claude/jail.conf b/jails/instances/lab-claude/jail.conf
index 564d94d..0fad1c4 100644
--- a/jails/instances/lab-claude/jail.conf
+++ b/jails/instances/lab-claude/jail.conf
@@ -10,6 +10,9 @@ lab-claude {
   exec.prepare += "mkdir -p ${path}/data/lab-submissions.git";
   mount += "/jails/share/lab-submissions.git ${path}/data/lab-submissions.git nullfs rw 0 0";
 
+  exec.prepare += "mkdir -p ${path}/data/secrets";
+  mount += "/jails/data/lab-claude/secrets ${path}/data/secrets nullfs ro 0 0";
+
   allow.mount;
   allow.mount.devfs;
   allow.mount.fdescfs;
